-- Position numbering continues from part 1's last value (671 onwards).
-- T31 (Hymn - Ifrit) is an empty placeholder — single row with empty
-- description is dropped per batch plan.
-- T40 Chocobo Jam has many rows where Source is "Roland - SOUND CANVAS
-- SC-8820" but Path/Preset are the literal word "UNKNOWN" — preserved
-- verbatim (path_bank = 'UNKNOWN') per Rule 2. Other rows where Source =
